Z||000000||ocalafiero1||09-15-2001||09:06 PM||||My wife and I were pulling into the driveway this evening, for some reason I looked at the odometer and noticed that I just hit 50,000 miles on my '86 2M4. The car almost bought the farm last night, though, during tropical storm Gabrielle's trip to Florida. I hear a crack and a crunch, and went outside. The fiero was parked next to our truck, and a huge tree limb had fallen between the two, not putting a scratch on either one. Talk about luck.<P>Mike||||reg||1
